whipper.description:
{Whipper}

{gold|Special Ability : Generate resource}

The presence of any Whipper in hero army produces 50 gold every day. Effect doesn't cumulate with Overseers.

overseer.description:
{Overseer}

{gold|Special Ability : Generate resource}

The presence of any Overseer in hero army produces 75 gold every day. Effect doesn't cumulate with Whippers.

wadjet.description:
{Wadjet}

{gold|Special Ability : Flying}

Flying is a special ability of creatures, which allows them to bypass obstacles (e.g. walls) during combat. Having creatures with this special ability in a hero's army does not affect the movement of that hero on the adventure map in any way (meaning that flying creatures also cause a movement penalty on non-native terrain).

