sekhmet.description:
{Sekhmet}

{gold|Special Ability : Ranged attack. Can cast Cure}

Sekhmets can cast three times per battle cure spell at advanced level. Cure heals 25 HP.
Ranged attack is a special ability of creatures, which allows them to attack without engaging into hand-to-hand combat. When attacking in melee, most ranged creatures suffer melee penalty, which halves their damage. Ranged penalty halves the ranged damage farther away than 10 hexes.

